{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17383","headline":"酬张秘监阁老喜太常中书二阁老与德舆同日迁官相代之作 · 权德舆","name":"酬张秘监阁老喜太常中书二阁老与德舆同日迁官相代之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠树共飞栖，分封受紫泥。\n正名推五字，贵仕仰三珪。\n继组心知忝，腰章事颇齐。\n蓬山有佳句，喜气在新题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}